&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt"&gt;More information about Vancouver&rsquo;s Neighborhood Traffic Calming Program,&amp;nbsp;past projects,&amp;nbsp;details&amp;nbsp;and requirements can be found at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW240059969 BCX8" href="https://www.cityofvancouver.us/trafficcalmingprogram" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size:10.5pt"&gt;cityofvancouver.us/TrafficCalmingProgram&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

