&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Information on Clark County Law Library&rsquo;s wide variety of self-help kits including ordering instructions is available on the county&rsquo;s website at &lt;a href="https://clark.wa.gov/law-library/self-help-form-kits"&gt;https://clark.wa.gov/law-library/self-help-form-kits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

