&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Developed with support from the Southwest Washington Accountable Community of Health (SWACH) and the Washington State Department of Health (WADOH), the program awarded&amp;nbsp;nine&amp;nbsp;applicants&amp;nbsp;up to $1,000 each to cover training registration, travel, and lodging costs. An&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;five recipients received funding for certification-related expenses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
