&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3:00 p.m. &ndash; 7:00 p.m.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Valley Public House&lt;br /&gt;
12960 SE 162nd Ave, Happy Valley, OR 97086&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

