&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Aaron White, 43, of Salem,&amp;nbsp;the son of the victim,&amp;nbsp;was arrested and formally charged with Murder in the Second Degree.&amp;nbsp;This marks the first murder case investigated by the Criminal Investigation Section in 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
