&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Additionally, the second suspicious death investigation, in Wallace Marine Park, reported in the original media release,&amp;nbsp;remains&amp;nbsp;ongoing and no further details are available at this time. There is no ongoing threat to the public related to either of these investigations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
