&lt;p&gt;The February Tualatin Valley Water District (TVWD) Board Work Session will be held February 3, 2026 at 6:00 p.m.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(35, 31, 32)"&gt;If you wish to attend this meeting remotely or in person, please email&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="mailto:sam.kaufmann@tvwd.org"&gt;sam.kaufmann@tvwd.org&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="color:rgb(35, 31, 32)"&gt;or call 503-848-3094 by 4:30 p.m. on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif"&gt;February 3, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

