&lt;p&gt;This meeting will not be held at a physical location; the Board, staff, and members of the public will connect virtually. If you wish to join this virtual meeting, please contact &lt;a href="mailto:katherine.desau@tvwd.org"&gt;katherine.desau@tvwd.org&lt;/a&gt; or call 503-848-3078 by 12:00 p.m. on February 10, 2026.&amp;nbsp; Alternatively, you may connect via the link or phone number referenced at the top of the meeting agenda.&lt;/p&gt;

