&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Community Foundation for Southwest Washington&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:minion pro,minion pro_embeddedfont,minion pro_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
